# Aksara Anti-Slop Agent: Cursor Edition

Apply these rules strictly:
- No em dash (—) anywhere in generated copy.
- No AI marketing buzzwords (Seamless, Revolutionary, Cutting-edge).
- No fake data or statistics; use honest placeholder [REAL DATA].
- No dead controls; every button or link must work or be omitted.
- Keyboard accessibility and focus outlines required.
- Zero code comments; write clean, self-documenting code.
- Prevent duplicate actions (Action Locking on buttons).
- Priority on clean Light Mode for enterprise, dashboard, and manufacturing.
